      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "ICARUS mission control, 1920x1080.\n\nThe move: plates, not cards. A panel is one hairline rule plus four corner ticks over an ink wash, so the Earth reads through it - no rounded glass cards, no blur.\n\nType: IBM Plex Mono for every number, Archivo at wide tracking for every label.\n\nSafe mode is on the artboard to the right."
